    "body": "Refreshed per the maintainer's instruction (2026-11-13: \"Fix - 1047, use Slave\"): merged main (f461a2614) into the branch - new head bbfee96aa, GitHub reports MERGEABLE. Hand-resolved conflicts, keep-both-sides: crates/app/src/posting.rs (the Z1 machine row kept beside main's Sienci trio and the reworked Doosan pair) and crates/app/tests/machine.rs (expectations in every_shipped_machine_mounts_and_speaks_its_declaration matched to that order). The Z1 post logic, its refusal tests and makera-z1.mch are untouched PR content; no snapshot/CHANGELOG/RECOMMENDED edits on either side; PROCESS_VERSION stays main's 63. Quick gate on the merged head: green (9/9 lanes, machine 33/33, makera_z1 4/4, ui suites, clippy -D warnings). Delta class: DELTA - conflict resolved by hand, due a read-only delta review of the merge commit's remerge-diff. The earlier Z1 hand-check note on the issue stands.\n",
